  "source_moment_derivation": "Temporal inverse output is normalized-Haar zero. Radial T1 translation preserves Haar integrals; compact support permits Fubini. Five homogeneous rows give exactly integral R^2 Delta v=0 and integral R Delta gamma=0. Their sums are (9.10). The other three exact rows use fresh post-temporal targets and leave complete nonlinear remainder defects, not zero defects.",
